Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Selune's_Blessing:_Lunar_Brand\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Selune%27s_Blessing:_Lunar_Brand_(Condition)\" title=\"Selune's Blessing: Lunar Brand (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Selune's Blessing: Lunar Brand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Selune's Blessing: Lunar Brand</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Your attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-